om2
note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
note q: next row, K, has cached rows; outputs source/destination offsets and cache miss.
fn arxnext q edit ulong 16 rows view uint * have edit uchar * to ulong
i = get q 0
if ge i len rows
ret 0
end
r = ulong get rows i
put q 5 i
put q 6 r
put q 7 1
if ne get q 2 0
if ne get have r 0
put q 7 0
end
put have r 1
end
put q 8 mul r get q 1
put q 9 mul i get q 1
put q 10 get q 1
put q 11 mul get q 1 4
put q 12 mul get q 1 2
put q 0 add i 1
ret 1
end
